          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24431' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98698' x='651' y='49999'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true'>&quot;Assortment Offering&quot; Metrics Definition:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>1.</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> #Distinct PIM L2 categories</run>
              <run bold='true'> : Distinct PIM L2 categories listed/offered on the platform</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>2. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>#Master Product IDs</run>
              <run bold='true'> : Distinct product Master IDs  listed/offered on the platform; Master IDs are unique product identifiers at a global level</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>3. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>#Distinct Product Master Codes</run>
              <run bold='true'> : Distinct product Master codes  listed/offered on the platform; Master codes are known to be unique at a regional level</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>4. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'># Vendors</run>
              <run bold='true'> : Distinct vendors whose offering is visible in the central data</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>5. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Avg. SKU per Vendor</run>
              <run bold='true'> : Formula used to calculate this is - [sum(unique listed SKUs per vendor) / Vendor count]</run>
            </formatted-text>
